# The Maruera tree on Uzo: ObjType_Events $10, loc_DB90 (ps2.asm:20113),
# an Obj_InvisibleBlock2 ($38) at x 2256, y 272 -- $2C 7, loc_7278 row
# 7: 32 wide from x - 16, 16 high from y, so cells 140-141 on row 17.
# The first visit (d2 0) with event_flags $10 ($C720) clear is "This is
# it! This is the Maruera-tree." ($1710) and nothing else; the next idle
# one (d2 1, loc_DBAC) is loc_E84A with ItemID_MruraLeaf, $1702 then
# $1703. With the flag set the first visit is $1708 and the box closes.
# Before build 73: $1708 and "level: A on object type 0 index $10 is not
# ported".

start level $12 140 18
wait idle
press up
wait idle
expect level $12 140 18
press a
wait idle
expect script $1710
shot 01_the_tree
# (build 141b) The mist: plane A's backdrop blocks on the cave tileset draw
# loc_412F8's tiles in line 1 entry 7, $ECA (LoadLevelData, loc_9222).
# Until 141b the port loaded neither and the sky here was bare.
expect pixel 5 8 $ECA
press c
wait idle
expect script $1702
expect script $1703
shot 02_a_leaf
press c
wait idle
expect item MruraLeaf
press a
wait idle
expect script $1708
press c
wait idle
expect no-stderr not ported
